{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32415","headline":"和太常杜少卿东都修[行]里有嘉莲 · 温庭筠","name":"和太常杜少卿东都修[行]里有嘉莲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春秋罢注直铜龙，旧宅嘉莲照水红。\n两处龟巢清露里，一时鱼跃翠茎东。\n同心表瑞荀池上，半面分妆乐镜中。\n应爲临川多丽句，故持重艳向西风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32415.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32415","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}